    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must be utilizing Frost Dragon Style</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1-2 Focus</p><p>Your implacable will cannot be held, deferred, or deterred.</p><p>As a <strong>Free Action</strong> on your turn, you may spend <strong>-1 Focus</strong> to immediately remove one of the following <strong>Conditions</strong>: <strong>Frightened, Off-Balance, Prone, Restrained</strong>, or <strong>Stunned.</strong></p><p>You may spend <strong>-2 Focus</strong> to remove one of the following <strong>Conditions</strong> if it inflicted by a temporary effect: <strong>Blinded, Contaminated</strong>, or <strong>Deafened,</strong></p><p>You may spend <strong>-2 Focus</strong> and one <strong>Action</strong> to remove <strong>Incapacitated</strong> if it is inflicted by a temporary effect.</p>",
